{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_013hib01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_013hib01_title", "source_sha256": "73c6002756a2ad5cc1be08fdee4c36778dd0eb146e46a6d1cb16ac63b90e36a1", "ja": "響とおでかけ1", "zh": "和响出门1", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_013hib01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_013hib01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3702580dc6dfc8728503b6580a3bdf2b3091a5377b8d17384ae2e6a5a08c454a", "ja": "響とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和响一起出门的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_013hib01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_013hib01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "232f23e9d38147724c6a435e36bbef791a911125f99aefa3891d7901daec1b5b", "ja": "（広島での響の仕事は、野外でのトークライブ。\n天気が良くてよかったな！）", "zh": "（响在广岛的工作是在户外进行的演讲会。天气这么好，真是太好了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_013hib01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_013hib01_1001_null", "source_sha256": "537f0dc9221112b4252b788f4e91d4dc8897ffc883a74b6e7b6cff607a494e0e", "ja": "トークライブ終了後……", "zh": "Talk Live结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_013hib01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_013hib01_1002_013hib", "source_sha256": "58068a94ae292a8b69433d9538a5872347e1d2fb3ab6c1daf562b02618ffc2ad", "ja": "{$P$}……。\nお客さん、どうだった？　怒ってなかった……？", "zh": "{$P$}……\n客人怎么样？没生气吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_013hib01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_013hib01_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "bca7b594c416bfd664c276778fc1980dfe89c55278a7cf0a67011c410ce88730", "ja": "自分、お好み焼きのことを『広島焼き』って\n言っちゃうなんて……あんなに注意してたのに～！", "zh": "我居然把大阪烧说成了“广岛烧”……明明之前一直提醒自己不能说的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_013hib01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_013hib01_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "2c0f73b29a3ce3186948ff0f21141a425f396c9a78aaf0550dc430bdff20abc3", "ja": "MCでも言ったけど、「絶対言わないぞ！」って\n考えてたら、逆に口から出ちゃったんだ……うう……。", "zh": "主持环节我也说了，就是因为一直在想“绝对不能说漏嘴！”，\n结果反而脱口而出了……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_013hib01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_013hib01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "954c532f3e616b8a944f7fe72736c860c429de1a975fc8633034668e150d9a9e", "ja": "一瞬、客席が静まり返ったからな……\n本当にセンシティブな問題なんだな。", "zh": "刚才观众席一瞬间安静下来了……\n看来这真的是个敏感的问题啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_013hib01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_013hib01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "0c7a0afa2e36e8f72025576c3a2c1fd844d033329c6327c97c433710ac2f2283", "ja": "でも、帰っていくお客さん達は、みんな笑顔だったよ。\nだからイヤな気持ちにはなっていないと思う。", "zh": "不过，离开的客人们脸上都带着笑容。\n所以我想，他们应该没有感到不舒服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_013hib01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_013hib01_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "0cb0aa0ac1a08843b21996f04d2ae9f8e59855a73b934efb99e3ae9323d3e904", "ja": "それならよかった……。でも、気を付けないとね。\n地方ごとに大事にしているものは、尊重したいんだ！", "zh": "那就好……不过，还是要多加注意才行。\n我想尊重每个地方所珍视的东西！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_013hib01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_013hib01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "45b0755ba8a21a62f5ad313ccaa5c94a2a9d84b4108c6620d442d341f271ea25", "ja": "うん。そうだな。そこに気付けるなんて、さすが響だ。", "zh": "嗯。确实是呢。能注意到这一点，不愧是响。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_013hib01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_013hib01_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "62e846b015784a2ce1d957300cff30fb5b4fc92bd979715dde21a9c8f68bfd60", "ja": "でしょ？　でも、もう覚えたから！\n自分、2部では絶対、ぜーったい言わないからね！", "zh": "对吧？不过我已经记住了！\n我在2部绝对、绝对不会说了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0251_story_013hib01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_013hib01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "02f2910e5d1522acefe54468c31526076c028fa34ff89f40e8bfa15ddf36b80f", "ja": "（こういう経験も、全国営業の醍醐味だな。\n少しずつ、色んな事を知って行こう！）", "zh": "这种经历也是跑遍全国开展活动的乐趣所在啊。接下来就一点点了解各种各样的事情吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
